    "type": "question",
    "label": "24",
    "prompt": "On a $6\\times6$ grid of points, how many rectangles with sides parallel to the grid rows and columns can be formed from the points as their vertices?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$225$ rectangles.\n\nChoose two rows and two columns.",
      "worked": "Each rectangle is determined by two rows and two columns of points.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\binom{6}{2}\\binom{6}{2}\\\\N&=15\\times15\\\\N&=225.\\end{align*}$$",
